ype="display-unstructured">Liu G, Seiler H, Wen A, Zars T, Ito K, Wolf R, Heisenberg M, Liu L (2006) Distinct memory traces for two visual features in the Drosophila brain. Nature 439:551&#x02013;556 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16452971</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Matsumoto</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Mizunami</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Olfactory learning in the cricket <italic>Gryllus bimaculatus</italic></article-title><source>J Exp Biol</source><year>2000</year><volume>203</volume><fpage>2581</fpage><lpage>2588</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Matsumoto Y, Mizunami M (2000) Olfactory learning in the cricket Gryllus bimaculatus. J Exp Biol 203:2581&#x02013;2588 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10934001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Matsumoto</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Mizunami</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Context-dependent olfactory learning in an insect</article-title><source>Learn Mem</source><year>2004</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>288</fpage><lpage>293</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1101/lm.72504</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Matsumoto Y, Mizunami M (2004) Context-dependent olfactory learning in an insect. Learn Mem 11:288&#x02013;293 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15169858</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mobbs</surname><given-names>PG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The brain of the honeybee <italic>Apis mellifera</italic>. I. The connections and spatial organization of the mushroom bodies</article-title><source>Philos Trans R Soc L